# NL-ACC demo with the UCO and Datalink plugins: the same 18 flights, with automatic handovers between simulated
# units, and CPDLC uplinks answered by a simulated pilot.
# Set your ATR position before loading this.
00:00:00.00>PLUGIN UCO
00:00:00.00>PCALL iLabs/uco-airspace.scn
00:00:00.00>UCODELAY 10
00:00:00.00>PLUGIN DATALINK
00:00:00.00>PCALL iLabs/NL-ACC-demo.scn

# Delete each flight 60 s after it lands (passes 50 ft on the way down). At 1 s: after the demo has created them
00:00:01.00>ATALT KLM1857 50 DELAY 60 DEL KLM1857
00:00:01.00>ATALT EZY7934 50 DELAY 60 DEL EZY7934
00:00:01.00>ATALT TRA5731 50 DELAY 60 DEL TRA5731
00:00:01.00>ATALT KLM1339 50 DELAY 60 DEL KLM1339
00:00:01.00>ATALT BAW437 50 DELAY 60 DEL BAW437
00:00:01.00>ATALT BEL7PC 50 DELAY 60 DEL BEL7PC
00:00:01.00>ATALT BAW982 50 DELAY 60 DEL BAW982
00:00:01.00>ATALT EWG9KM 50 DELAY 60 DEL EWG9KM
00:00:01.00>ATALT NAX4CE 50 DELAY 60 DEL NAX4CE
00:00:01.00>ATALT DLH4RK 50 DELAY 60 DEL DLH4RK
00:00:01.00>ATALT DLH6AK 50 DELAY 60 DEL DLH6AK
00:00:01.00>ATALT SAS1549 50 DELAY 60 DEL SAS1549
00:00:01.00>ATALT AFR1640 50 DELAY 60 DEL AFR1640
00:00:01.00>ATALT BAW428 50 DELAY 60 DEL BAW428
00:00:01.00>ATALT RYR5KJ 50 DELAY 60 DEL RYR5KJ
00:00:01.00>ATALT KLM1142 50 DELAY 60 DEL KLM1142
00:00:01.00>ATALT UAE147 50 DELAY 60 DEL UAE147
00:00:01.00>ATALT WZZ4471 50 DELAY 60 DEL WZZ4471
